PROJECT Portal

DATABASE SQLITE

AUTH SESSION

USE auth.roles
USE auth.email_verification
USE auth.oauth.github

MODEL User
    name STRING

MODEL Post
    title STRING
    body TEXT OPTIONAL

RELATION User HAS_MANY Post

VALIDATE email REQUIRED EMAIL
VALIDATE password REQUIRED MIN 8

ROUTE GET /posts
ROUTE POST /posts
ROUTE PATCH /posts/{id}
ROUTE DELETE /posts/{id} ROLE admin
